# Migration SQL must stay LF in the working tree on every platform. The
# isolated production migration runner (lib/e8-tables-migration-runner.ts)
# pins each file's SHA-256 in EXPECTED_MIGRATION_SHA256, computed from the
# LF-normalized bytes git stores. Without this rule, core.autocrlf=true
# checks these files out as CRLF on Windows, so the runner's own
# fs.readFileSync + sha256 sees CRLF bytes and every hash check fails
# (HASH_MISMATCH). eol=lf keeps checkout, hashing, and applyMigrations*
# byte-identical to the committed blobs everywhere.
drizzle/*.sql text eol=lf
